OL,3,GNEWSAChild rapist who drugged
OL,4,A12-year-old girl jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who drugged and raped a
OL,7,F12-year-old girl has been jailed for
OL,8,Fnine years.
OL,10,FAccording to South Yorkshire Police,
OL,11,Fthe victim had been missing from home
OL,12,Fand was found in the company of Adam
OL,13,FBatley, who was 28 at the time.
OL,15,FBatley, now 30 and from Barnsley, was
OL,16,Farrested and the girl later disclosed
OL,17,Fthe abuse she had suffered, including
OL,18,Fbeing plied with drink and drugs, to
OL,19,Fher social workers.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
