OL,3,GNEWSAChild rapist who drugged
OL,4,A12-year-old girl jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBatley, who was sentenced on Wednesday,
OL,7,Fwas ordered to serve a nine-year jail
OL,8,Fterm, with an extended licence period
OL,9,Fof 12 months on release.
